  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Joint Programme (JP) is designed to assist the Government of Serbia (GoS) in achieving its strategic and UNSDCF goals of enhancing public services for all, with a focus on the most vulnerable, and to fast-track the achievement of SDGs by transitioning from an institution-centric to a people-centric approach in public service design. Primary goal of the JP is to implement in government a new approach to digital service development in general, which is a prerequisite for improving specific se</narrative>
